      "The picture presents a thought-provoking scene: five people are gathered around a long table for a meeting, four of them staring at their computer screens, while a standing man remarks, \"We have lots of information technology. We just don't have much useful information.\" Simple as it is, the drawing points to a striking paradox of our digital age.",
